Chieu ngay 30/3/2011, tai Ha Noi, Uy ban Dan toc da to chuc hop bao cong bo va thong bao ke hoach to chuc cac hoat dong huong toi ky niem 65 nam ngay thanh lap co quan QLNN ve linh vuc cong tac dan toc (3/5/1946 - 3/5/2011). Pho Chu nhiem Hoang Xuan Luong chu tri buoi hop bao. Tham du hop bao co dai dien lanh dao cua: Hoi dong Dan toc (Quoc hoi), Bo VHTT&DL, Bo TT&TT, Ban Tuyen giao Trung uong; dai dien lanh dao cac Vu, don vi cua UBDT; cac co quan thong tan bao chi: Dai Truyen hinh Viet Nam, Dai Tieng noi Viet Nam; TTXVN, bao Dien tu Dang Cong san va cac bao thuoc Chuong trinh 975.
